OL,3,GNEWSASchools close early for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of schools closed early due to
OL,7,Fsafety concerns over a funeral linked
OL,8,Fto a crash which killed seven people.
OL,10,FDozens of people attended the funeral
OL,11,Fin South Bank, near Middlesbrough, of
OL,12,FJakub Matusiak, 23, one of five young
OL,13,Fmen killed in the head-on collision
OL,14,Fwith a marked police car on the A66.
OL,16,FHead teachers had warned parents that
OL,17,Flarge crowds were expected to gather at
OL,18,FSt John The Evangelist Church for the
OL,19,Ffuneral, with traffic problems likely,
OL,20,Fbut police reported "minimal"
OL,21,Fdisruption.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
