OL,3,GNEWSASchools close early for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crash on 22 August saw a Volkswagen
OL,7,FPassat travelling the wrong way on the
OL,8,Fdual carriageway near South Bank hit
OL,9,Fthe police car. PC Matthew Blades, 37,
OL,10,Fand PC Tom Clough, 38, were also
OL,11,Fkilled.
